content.text:
Now CSS. Need add `.solo-btn`, `.solo-card`, `.mode-chip`, `.badge.solo`; adjust field/hand card art removal. Let's carefully edit.

1. Add `.solo-btn` near topbar buttons. CSS:
```
.solo-btn {
 display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; height:28px; padding:0 10px;
 border:1px solid rgba(77,244,255,.28); border-radius:999px;
 background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(77,244,255,.14), rgba(155,107,255,.1));
 color: var(--cyan-soft); cursor:pointer; transition...
}
.solo-btn b {font:700 9px...; letter-spacing:1.4px;}
.solo-btn span {font:600 6.5px...; color:var(--dim); letter-spacing:1px;}
.solo-btn:hover, .solo-btn.active {...}
```
Mobile: maybe hide span, height 29, padding 0 8. At max-width 720 add `.solo-btn span { display:none }` and maybe b 8px.

2. Add `.solo-card` CSS after my-room or before room-tools:
```
.solo-card { margin: 0 11px 6px; padding: 9px 11px; border...; border-radius:10px; background...; }
.solo-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font...}
.solo-head span { color: var(--violet?) } etc
.solo-card p { margin: 5px 0 7px; font: 500 7px/1.4 var(--font-jp); color:var(--dim);}
.solo-levels { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap:4px;}
.solo-levels button {...}
.solo-levels button.active {...}
```
Could be compact ~75px.

3. `.badge.solo`.

4. `.mode-chip`:
```
.mode-chip { padding:2px 7px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:999px; font:700 6.5px/1 var(--font-display); letter-spacing:1.2px; color:var(--muted); background:rgba(0,0,0,.2); white-space:nowrap;}
.mode-chip.solo { color:var(--violet); border-color:rgba(155,107,255,.4); background:rgba(155,107,255,.08);}
```
Board-head has 4 children; `justify-content:space-between`. On desktop okay. On mobile `.board-tag.right{display:none}`, so 3. Fine. But mode chip may push; small.

5. Field card redesign. Replace `.field-card` grid declarations and `.fc-art` block. We'll edit:
- `.field-card` change display grid -> flex column; remove grid-template columns/rows/gap maybe `gap:1px;`.
- `.fc-art` remove block and svg rule.
- `.fc-cost` currently position absolute left 1 top1, fine; maybe left 3 top3, width 15.
- `.fc-name` add `margin: 14px 0 0;` and maybe padding-left 1.
- `.fc-el` fine.
- `.fc-stats` currently `grid-column: 2;` remove; add `margin-top:auto;`.
- `.fc-ability` right top fine.

Need ensure `.fc-name` margin-top 14 makes card content: cost 15 high, name starts 14; 2 lines 18; element 6; stats 10; total ~50 + padding 8 = 58, field height ~80. Fine. On mobile field height maybe 72, okay. If name 2 lines and stats, 14+18+6+10=48 + padding 8 =56, fits. Good.

6. Hand card:
- Remove `.hand-card .hc-art` and svg rules.
- `.hc-body` padding 5px -> `30px 7px 0` (desktop). But card height 118, name 2 lines 22, en 6, stats 12 bottom, hpbar 2 => 30+22+6+? bottom. Fine.
- `.hc-stats` bottom 7.
- `.hc-cost` top 7.
- `.hc-ability` top right.
- At max-width 1180 `.hand-card .hc-art` declaration remove.
- At 720 `.hand-card .hc-body` currently padding 3px 5px 0 -> change 26px 5px 0; remove `.hc-art` rule.
- At 440 remove `.hc-art`; maybe body padding 24px 4px 0.
- At max-height 760 remove `.hc-art`; body maybe default.

Could add `.hc-body::before` small element bar? Not necessary.

Let's use perl or edit. For exact blocks, use edit.

